      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我是这么想的，可那家伙还真成功躲了我一整天。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20033030050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003303007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不是主动找班上的朋友聊天，让我插不进去，/n就是一直低头摆弄手机。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20033030060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003303008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "一旦留心观察，就能看出绯花里明显在避开直播相关的话题，/n还总是想方设法让自己不用和我说话。",
      "VoiceFileName": "20033030070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003303009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "她照样有精神，也照样一直笑。/n难道只是我们以前没发现，她其实一直都这样？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20033030080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003303010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那个“只会跳舞的自来熟”会这样？",
      "VoiceFileName": "20033030090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 2003303011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 2003303,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "事情就是这样。",
